From: Aleks <aleks.spv@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 10:25:53 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 136/194] ASoC: dt-bindings: awinic,aw88395: Add AW88263S

AW88263S is a sibling of the AW88261 smart amplifier with a different
register layout, found e.g. in the Xiaomi Redmi Note 10 Pro (sweet).
It is handled by the aw88261 driver, so document its compatible here.

Signed-off-by: Aleks <aleks.spv@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml
index b9abb1094..fca2c1874 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ properties:
       - awinic,aw88083
       - awinic,aw88166
       - awinic,aw88261
+      - awinic,aw88263s
       - awinic,aw88395
       - awinic,aw88399
 
